nter.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Category:No_Material_items\" title=\"Category:No Material items\">None</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Category:No_Material_items\" title=\"Category:No Material items\">None</a>:</b> There is no material defined for this item.  Quivers and cosmetic/store items have no listed material.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\" width=\"150\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\" width=\"450\">9,700 pp\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">1.00 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #EEBBEE\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #F0E4F0\"><b><a href=\"/page/A_Cry_for_Help\" title=\"A Cry for Help\">A Cry for Help</a></b>, and <b><a href=\"/page/Foundation_of_Discord\" title=\"Foundation of Discord\">Foundation of Discord</a></b>, end chest (epic normal); <b><a href=\"/page/Return_to_Gianthold\" title=\"Return to Gianthold\">Return to Gianthold</a></b>, quest chain end reward\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Unique item capacity\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>3\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Max stack size\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<p>1,000\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Venomed_Ammunition\" title=\"Venomed Ammunition\">Venomed Ammunition - 1d6</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Venomed_Ammunition\" title=\"Venomed Ammunition\">Venomed Ammunition - 1d6</a>:</b> On Ranged Attack: 1 to 6 Poison Damage</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Quiver_of_Poison_(Level_23).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Quiver_of_Poison_%28Level_23%29.png/420px-Quiver_of_Poison_%28Level_23%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"343\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Quiver_of_Poison_%28Level_23%29.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><i>Ammunition stored in this quiver is magically coated with vile toxins, causing your ranged attacks to deal debilitating effects of these magical poisons for as long as this quiver is equipped. This large, thin quiver will hold 3 different types of arrow or bolt and can store each type in a stack of up to 1000. Total capacity: 3000.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">* Per Update 21 Release Notes: The Quiver of Poison is now Bind on Acquire, instead of claiming it was Bind on Equip, as this type of item is unable to function properly as Bind on Equip.\n<ul><li><b>Bug: </b> The <b>Quiver of Poison</b>&#39;s poison damage does not appear in the combat log.<span class=\"citation\"><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forums-old.ddo.com/forums/showthread.php/478575\">DDO Forums</a></span>&#160;<sup id=\"old&#95;forums&#95;link&#95;3\" style=\"background-color: #FFAAAA;\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/save/https%3A%2F%2Fforums-old.ddo.com%2Fforums%2Fshowthread.php%2F478575\"><abbr title=\"The old forums this link points to were shut down on August 31st, 2025. If this is important, please consider revising the template call as described at &#91;&#91;Template:Forums&#93;&#93;.\" style=\"display: initial;\">ARCHIVE ME!</abbr></a></sup></span></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816231326\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3310/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28116/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9219/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 15/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n141.11%  128.017     47 Template:IO\n100.00%   90.720      